{"Categories":[8],"HiddenTopics":[],"Topics":[3],"Id":120,"TextResource":{"Name":"telepizza","Translations":[{"Text":"Telepizza","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Telepizza","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":55},{"FloorId":"3","Id":117},{"FloorId":"1","Id":219}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>¿Busca recetas tradicionales o prefiere armar su propia pizza? En Telepizza puede elegir cualquiera de estas opciones para crear un sinfín de preparaciones, acompañadas de una exquisita bollería que te permitirá para una grata estadía, sólo o en compañía.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>Are you looking for traditional recipes or would you rather put together your own pizza? At Telepizza you can choose either option to create a large number of preparations, accompanied by delicious bakery products that will provide for a great experience, either on your own or with company.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916788","Updated":"1489712624","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/120_telepizza.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/viadirect\/361\/node\/391","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/viadirect\/361\/node\/391","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/120_telepizza.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/120\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/120_telepizza.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/120\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[{"key":"field_opening_hours","label":"Opening hours","field_name":"field_restaurant_opening_hours"},{"key":"field_phone","label":"Phone","field_name":"field_restaurant_phone"},{"key":"field_website","label"